#
#   navigable_5 - HTML::Navigable: navigating a navigable, and navigating to a fragment
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/Navigable.cpp lines 1806-2287 (Navigable::navigate,
#       begin_navigation with its in-parallel steps, navigate_to_a_fragment). The navigation
#       API's events (Navigation) are phase 3 closure stubs; fetching is phase 2.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2022-2024, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
